      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like i'm just... tainted. like everything i touch stays dirty because of what i did. i saw them get hurt and i just stood there. i didn't even move. i just watched. it feels like i owe a debt to the world that i can never actually pay back. like i'm just a walking error that shouldn't even be here.",
